From 3b4b6239f90bd5e98c3d893d2d2a0f10a4912c3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 22:18:23 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Make the pick wheel customizable

- Choices on the wheel: 2-12 spots (hidden names are kept)
- Skip last pick toggle with modes: whole round / last pick / last 2 picks
- Double a name (2x): pick how many (1-3) and which names; twins sit across the wheel
- Spin again spaces (1-3) that land without counting as a pick
- Shuffle button rearranges names; winners and doubles follow their names
- Schema v3 with migration from v1/v2 saves; tests updated for all options

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012CQZCL7k2NkgW7uC8AAxsu
